t(34, 705, """Some of the honorable follower brothers think these posts are replies to individuals .. These posts have two aims and no third:
1- To show the error in the idea of the one being answered, for if we do not correct the idea, what do we do?
2- To show the error in the behavior of the blocked person, that he may benefit from the advice and change his behavior.

One of the blocked, objecting violently to the discourse on the pictures being published, said: "If Allah wanted to create Paradise on Earth He would have created it; rather, the Earth is for the religion to be established in it, to prevail and to be dominant and victorious"! So he confined the religion to wars, raids and people entering Islam, and did not understand that people can enter Islam because of the clean modern city far more than through conquests. He did not know that and did not learn it!

Leaving aside the brother's deficient understanding of the religion, the creed, Islam and the meaning of calling to Allah the Exalted on Earth, and how wealth and good treatment can bring people into Islam in droves, and that attracting people to live in the lands of Islam and get to know the true Islam guarantees, by Allah the Exalted's permission, their entering Islam in droves — and they have entered it, that is Islam, in droves in the era of the defamation of Islam, which is our era, so how would it be if they lived its true age and saw its reality; how many of them would enter Islam? But the blocked brother does not know how. He only knows that people must enter Islam. So when he enters the channel and finds pictures of justice in people's lives, the people happy, everything in their lives covered and their life easy and beautiful, he says: no, this is not Islam! Islam is spreading the religion! Fine, how will we spread the religion? He will say: by the sword, war and conquests! That is the extent of his understanding of Islam, so he objects to turning the lands of the Muslims into (gardens), figuratively, because he understands nothing of Islam but the side of wars!

And leaving aside this issue, which needs long hours of explanation, I reply only to a phrase the blocked brother said: "If Allah the Exalted wanted to create Paradise on Earth He would have created it" .. It seems the blocked brother knows nothing about countries that have provided their citizens with housing and livelihood and, by Allah's power, spared them the basic worries of this world. It seems our brother does not know that and news of it has not reached him! Here is a land in which Allah the Exalted has decreed what the brother sees as wrong! Allah the Exalted decreed it for non-Muslims in Europe, for its citizens. But the brother, because of his incorrect understanding of Islam, thinks that Allah's generosity with a good life is forbidden to Muslims but permitted only to non-Muslims! This is among the strangest of thoughts about Allah the Exalted!!

Wealth, civilization, providing all basic services to people with ease, offering people much for free and making their lives free of the worries of this world: this is among the greatest acts of nearness to Allah the Exalted and among the greatest tools for calling non-Muslims to Allah the Exalted! O my blocked brother, you were blocked because your manner of speaking is a dry, lecturing manner with harshness in it. Do you, when you enter an assembly in Egypt, in Saudi Arabia, in Kuwait or in any land where assemblies have their rules and etiquette, enter and treat those seated harshly and rudely? Or is the harshness only here because you are unknown and because the talk is from behind a screen?!""")

