t(41, 530, """When people say: a great problem will occur in the world, I say: let us move on to what comes after the problem! For the problem has its people, and what comes after the problem has its people! This is the ABC of the science of crisis management! One of the most important branches of Western management sciences.

Nations rise only through dismantling the mind! And the mind can only be dismantled by a thought whose basis is the mind's swift response to the next step, not merely to what has happened and to the reality dominating the psychological state! Nations rise through planning! Nations rise through a will supported from heaven! Nations rise through understanding the truths of life correctly, and its proof is the wisdom of the mind, the deliberateness of the soul and the soundness of logic! Nations rise through grasping what is hidden from people's understanding and from their minds! Nations rise through trust in Allah the Almighty our Lord, because He is the Owner of everything! Everything is subject to Him, sanctified be His names, with the submission of the subdued, not the submission of the one who chooses; even if the submissive one surrenders willingly, he is under subjugation from beginning to end! Nations rise when there are born in their lands, in their villages and in their cities, in their valleys and in their mountains, young men and young women .. and men and women .. who believe that with Allah they are able .. and believe that with Allah they are capable .. and believe that with Allah they will cross over!""")

