t(42, 1410, """The beginning of the end of the century? Or a new pause? Or the end of "the East"? .. Watching the situation is what rules the situation, and the situation requires watching the first day and perhaps the second for a fuller understanding of the course of events! Affirming final conclusions on the first day is difficult! The only thing clearly understood to me on the first day is that "the East" is throwing meteors worth perhaps 5000 dollars apiece, worthless meteors, in order to drain the very costly interceptor meteors .. a million or two million dollars for a single interceptor meteor, so that when the stock of interceptor meteors runs out or becomes scarce, "the East" sends the strategic meteors! The same game as the 12-day war!""")

t(42, 2015, """O people, beware, beware .. beware and be alarmed .. be alarmed at tasbih, tahlil, takbir and every dhikr said with a specific number that is not reported in the authentic Sunnah, for it is magic cast upon you while you say the dhikr .. O people, do not legislate from yourselves .. The numbers legislated for you are only the numbers mentioned in the authentic Sunnah .. I do not say these words for nothing .. The matter is serious, the problem is widespread and the cases are greatly increasing because of what the dajjals have spread among people on the internet. The number of those possessed today is known to none but Allah, but this type of possession is plentiful and has become common, and the symptoms are catastrophic. The latest I learned of who was struck by this type of possession is a mosque imam who abandoned prayer and began cursing the religion .. Fear Allah regarding yourselves, your religion and your souls .. The matter is real and not a joke .. Do not remember Allah with specific, fixed numbers other than what came literally in the authentic Prophetic Sunnah with a sound chain to the Messenger of Allah ﷺ. Do not destroy yourselves with your own hands by following the dajjals on the channels, for these are dajjals who cause people to be possessed so that the possessed one begins the imaginary journey of healing with them .. No dhikr 15 times or 22 times or 34 times or 2000 times or any number not in the authentic Sunnah. Do not do it .. Stop .. Halt .. Be alarmed, for the outcome is catastrophic and the result is a calamity that may last to the end of life.""")
